cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StructBench, please cite it as below."
title: StructBench
abstract: >-
  Verification and validation benchmarks for learned surrogates of
  structural response: reference data with declared uncertainty, a fixed
  task and split, evaluation protocols that test physical consistency
  alongside accuracy in physical units, and reference baselines that can
  be rerun — for structural response across loading regimes, from
  quasi-static contact to impact and fracture.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Qilin
version: 0.4.0
date-released: "2026-11-10"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/qilinli/StructBench"
url: "https://github.com/qilinli/StructBench"
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - structural engineering
  - surrogate modeling
  - structural response simulation
  - graph neural networks
  - neural operators
  - impact dynamics
  - quasi-static contact
  - LS-DYNA
